59
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:26,880
But getting this many people into the city, keeping the logistics moving, well,

60
00:04:26,940 --> 00:04:32,910
what can I say? This existential panic depicted by Munch in The Scream is something

61
00:04:32,940 --> 00:04:34,650
we could really resonate with at times.

62
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:42,091
Now look at the walls around you,

63
00:04:43,410 --> 00:04:48,690
because you're sitting inside one of Munch's most ambitious projects.

64
00:04:49,740 --> 00:04:52,980
It's prestigious. It was also a bit controversial in its day.

65
00:04:55,320 --> 00:05:00,750
Munch painted these paintings here in this room more than 100 years ago.

66
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:05,460
There are 11 paintings, and they tell the story of the university

67
00:05:06,720 --> 00:05:10,650
and the sciences. Behind The Scream is the image of the sun.

68
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:16,440
It symbolizes enlightenment as a sunrise.

69
00:05:17,730 --> 00:05:23,430
On that wall, we have history with an old man explaining something to

70
00:05:23,670 --> 00:05:24,330
a young boy.

71
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:28,320
On the left, we see alma mater,

72
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:32,610
the nourishing university,

73
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:40,110
reaching back to Bologna's Alma Mater Studiorum from 1088.

74
00:05:42,150 --> 00:05:47,400
And also, I think relevant for us, some of the sciences are also directly

75
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:47,970
referenced.

76
00:05:49,770 --> 00:05:50,310
We have

77
00:05:51,930 --> 00:05:56,100
over there in the corner is chemistry.

78
00:05:59,100 --> 00:05:59,460
Here

79
00:06:00,990 --> 00:06:02,490
in this corner, we have

80
00:06:04,110 --> 00:06:06,360
physics symbolized by the rays,

81
00:06:07,860 --> 00:06:10,620
and maybe my favorite, we have here

82
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,510
botany,

83
00:06:14,190 --> 00:06:17,790
these women harvesting from the tree of knowledge.

84
00:06:21,150 --> 00:06:26,610
So something about the room itself, the aula, this space is, I think everybody

85
00:06:26,701 --> 00:06:31,410
agrees in Oslo, that this is one of the most beautiful places to be.

86
00:06:32,460 --> 00:06:35,640
